OL,3,GNEWSAGas workers ignored UK safety
OL,4,Astandards, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff at Jersey's only gas company
OL,7,Foften liked to do things "the Jersey
OL,8,Fway" instead of following UK safety
OL,9,Fstandards, a former manager at Island
OL,10,FEnergy has told the Royal Court.
OL,12,FMark Wheeldon had worked for the
OL,13,Fcompany when an explosion occurred at
OL,14,FHaut du Mont on 10 December 2022,
OL,15,Fkilling 10 people.
OL,17,FGas workers Neil Armstrong, John Wright
OL,18,Fand Lee Ward deny 10 counts of gross
OL,19,Fnegligence manslaughter and Island
OL,20,FEnergy has pleaded not guilty in a
OL,21,Fcombined health and safety case.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
